{
  "name": "FF · Payments in",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## FF · Payments in (lesson 6.2)\nPaystack payment → verified twice → onboarded once.\n\n1. Signature: HMAC-SHA512 of the RAW body with your Paystack TEST secret key must equal the x-paystack-signature header. Else: log and stop.\n2. Route by event. On charge.success: verify the transaction with Paystack (status success, amount matches the tier), then skip references already in the Payments sheet.\n3. Deposit → Clients row, welcome pack, Telegram to Tolu, intake follow-up after 2 days.\n4. invoice.payment_failed → friendly reminder, note to Tolu, check-in 3 days later. No cut-off.\n\n**Credentials:** Header Auth \"Paystack test\" (Authorization = Bearer + TEST secret key), Google Sheets, Gmail, Telegram.\n**Environment:** PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY (test key), NODE_FUNCTION_ALLOW_BUILTIN=crypto, N8N_BLOCK_ENV_ACCESS_IN_NODE=false.\n**Replace:** YOUR_SHEET_ID, YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID, YOUR_BOOKING_LINK, YOUR_INTAKE_FORM_LINK, YOUR_SCOPE_LINK.\nSettings → Error workflow: choose your error workflow (3.6).",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 400
      },
      "id": "cd68cd6f-2282-44db-a0f5-bcf6b02068c2",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -528,
        -270
      ]
    },
