      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Check status and amount').first().json.email }}",
        "subject": "=Welcome to your automation project, {{ $('Check status and amount').first().json.business }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=Hello {{ $('Check status and amount').first().json.contact || 'there' }},\n\nThank you: your {{ $('Check status and amount').first().json.tier }} deposit of ₦{{ $('Check status and amount').first().json.amount_ngn.toLocaleString() }} has arrived (reference {{ $('Check status and amount').first().json.reference }}).\n\nYour signed scope: YOUR_SCOPE_LINK\n\nWhat happens next\nWeek 1: kick-off call and access to your accounts\nWeek 2: first working version, tested with your data\nWeek 3: your team tests it; we fix what they find\nWeek 4: go-live, handover and training\n\n1. Book the kick-off call: YOUR_BOOKING_LINK\n2. Fill in the intake form (accounts to share, data, contacts): YOUR_INTAKE_FORM_LINK\n\nAny questions, just reply to this email.\n\nTolu",
